#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:6
msgid "Use Vinheta in a Call"
msgstr "Vinheta in einem Anruf verwenden"

#: src/ui/call-guide-dialog.ui:32
msgid ""
"Vinheta plays your sounds into the apps that are using your microphone. For "
"the other side of a call to hear them:"
